  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.1: malformed/corrupt/empty/encrypted PDFs now raise a clear EasyOcrSharpException (instead of a raw underlying exception); added robustness/edge-case test coverage. No API changes. 2.2.0: built-in PDF input + searchable-PDF output; hOCR/ALTO/TSV/JSON exporters; OpenTelemetry metrics/tracing + health check; resilient resumable model downloads; automatic GPU (CUDA/CoreML) with CPU fallback; EasyOCR parity (beam / word-beam decoders, per-box rotation, recognize-from-boxes, custom recognizers, int8 quantized models, exposed grouping/contrast thresholds). All additive — existing APIs unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
